    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "OWNER",
            "body": "The `markers` check fails on `docs/tangles/custom/sp-org-tag-groups.org` (lines 97, 111, 115): leftover conflict markers from the merge of #249 into `main` (`e11bcc1`, still there on `main` at `0a9b33d`). This PR does not touch that file, so the failure is not from this change. A fix needs a choice between two versions of the \"Tag groups and their colours\" text (the older text with the `@@comment@@` note, or the #249 theme-based text), so I have not widened this PR; once `main` is fixed, bringing it in here makes the check pass.\n\nThe `tangle` check also fails, on `sp-search.el`, `sp-org-tag-groups.el` and `sp-org-custom-highlight.el`: their committed code differs from what their docs tangle to. This PR changes only `sp-writedesk` (its doc and `.el` agree), so these differences come from `main` too, and the conflicted `sp-org-tag-groups.org` is probably part of the cause. Needs a re-tangle or doc fix on `main`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
